<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    {{>layout/favicon}}
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>'{{keyword}}' 검색 결과 - 트리플에스 커뮤니티</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        .search-highlight b { color:#00f5d4; font-weight:800; }
        .search-snippet { display:-webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp:3; -webkit-box-orient:vertical; overflow:hidden; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-[#0d0e12] text-[#e3e2e8]">
{{>layout/header}}
<main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-8">
    <header class="mb-8 border-b border-[#3a4a46]/40 pb-5">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-[#00f5d4]">GLOBAL SEARCH</p>
        <h1 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold">‘{{keyword}}’ 검색 결과</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#8b9b95]">멤버 프로필과 게시글 제목·본문·작성자를 함께 검색합니다.</p>
    </header>

    {{#errorMessage}}
    <p class="mb-5 rounded-xl border border-amber-400/30 bg-amber-400/10 p-4 text-sm text-amber-100">{{errorMessage}}</p>
    {{/errorMessage}}

    <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#00f5d4]">person_search</span>멤버 검색 결과</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {{#memberResults}}
            <a href="{{profileUrl}}" class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#3a4a46]/40 bg-[#16181f]/80 p-4 no-underline transition hover:border-[#00f5d4]/60 hover:bg-[#1b2026]">
                <img src="{{profileImage}}" loading="lazy" alt="{{name}}" class="h-16 w-16 shrink-0 rounded-full border border-[#3a4a46]/50 object-cover">
                <span class="min-w-0">
                    <strong class="block text-base font-bold text-[#e3e2e8]">{{name}}</strong>
                    <span class="mt-1 block text-xs text-[#00f5d4]">{{engName}}</span>
                    <span class="mt-1 block text-xs text-[#8b9b95]">프로필 보기 →</span>
                </span>
            </a>
        {{/memberResults}}
        </div>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2 class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#00f5d4]">article</span>게시글 검색 결과</h2>
        {{#resultList}}
        <article class="mb-3 rounded-2xl border border-[#3a4a46]/35 bg-[#16181f]/70 p-5 transition hover:border-[#00f5d4]/35">
            <div class="mb-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                <span class="rounded-full border border-[#00f5d4]/25 bg-[#00f5d4]/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#00f5d4]">{{boardName}}</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-[#8b9b95]">작성자 {{userId}}</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">
                <a href="/article/{{category}}/{{id}}" class="search-highlight text-[#e3e2e8] no-underline hover:text-[#00f5d4]">{{{title}}}</a>
            </h3>
            <p class="search-highlight search-snippet mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#aebbb6]">{{{content}}}</p>
        </article>
        {{/resultList}}
        {{^resultList}}
        <p class="rounded-xl border border-[#3a4a46]/30 bg-[#16181f]/50 p-6 text-sm text-[#8b9b95]">검색어가 포함된 게시글이 없습니다.</p>
        {{/resultList}}
    </section>

    {{^hasAnyResults}}
    <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-[#3a4a46]/50 p-8 text-center text-sm text-[#8b9b95]">멤버 또는 게시글 검색 결과가 없습니다. 다른 검색어를 입력해 보세요.</div>
    {{/hasAnyResults}}
</main>
</body>
</html>